Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(03.1-41): worker-side L3 vision refine and preflight
 hook

- l3_refine renders disagreement pages (max 20, page order) and calls detect-vlm only with vlm_detect and cloud on
- a verdict replaces the page signals and sets layer L3; refused or failed pages keep the D-49 rule
- run_preflight counts L3 pages examined and derives tiers from verdicts

