+The worker renders the pages with pypdfium2 and hands the PNG bytes to the app's detect-vlm route, which owns the cloud switch, the
+page budget and the model call. L3 never blocks a job: a refused, failed or missing answer leaves the page on the D-49 higher-tier
+rule. Page images are passed only to the app client and are never logged.
+"""
 
